[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitlabelglyphmip"]

; One variable: the project's `gui/theme/default_font_generate_mipmaps`, true, set in this
; directory's project.godot. The default font then builds a mip chain for its glyph pages
; (`text_server_adv.cpp:3121`), and a `texture_filter` of 3 samples it. The text is minified,
; and the project's `texture_mipmap_bias` of -1 picks a sharper level. No other golden gives a
; Label3D a mip chain, so none shows a regression in it.

